<title>UK: DSL adds 100 million Swiss francs to Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DSL adds 100 million Swiss francs to Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 100 million Sfr to 250 million Sfr by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p>BORROWER  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND lANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    21.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    21.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 S&amp;P	   AAA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
